    "title": "Tippet Rise Art Center Unveils 2026 Season of Art And Music - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By A.A. Cristi ,\n1 days ago Tippet Rise Art Center has announced details for its 2026 season, running June 19 through October 4 on its 12,500-acre ranch in Fishtail, Montana. The site will reopen June 19 for hiking, biking, and sculpture tours, with new installations including Mark di Suvero’s Scythian and Alicja Kwade’s Causa Formalis. The center’s 15-mile trail system will also reopen to the public. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
